{"seq":6,"slug":"controversies-and-appraisal","title":"列奥纳多·达·芬奇·争议与评价","stage":"DONE","category":"leonardo-da-vinci","categoryLabel":"列奥纳多·达·芬奇","chapterCount":3,"docCount":6,"url":"/l-doc-books/c/people/leonardo-da-vinci/controversies-and-appraisal","rating":{"composite":3.69,"verdict":"stable","groups":{"quality":3.6,"coverage":3.25,"positioning":4,"strategic":4},"weights":{"quality":0.3,"coverage":0.25,"positioning":0.2,"strategic":0.25},"profile":null},"hubDir":"/Users/wangyang.learnwy/learnwy/learnwy/l-doc-hub/hubs/famous-people/35_leonardo-da-vinci/6_controversies-and-appraisal","introHtml":"<h1 id=\"列奥纳多-达-芬奇-争议与评价\">列奥纳多·达·芬奇·争议与评价</h1><p>本 hub 回答一个问题：当我们去掉颂歌，<strong>达·芬奇的缺憾、谜团与声望经得起多大的追问？</strong> 我们不复述他的生平与成就，而是聚焦三件事——他为何留下大量未竟之作、围绕他的神话与真伪争议如何被制造、以及他的「历史地位」究竟是怎样被建构出来的。本 hub 的一贯立场是：把「不朽」「全能天才」这类赞颂，<strong>还原为可清点的事实、可追踪的传播链与可标注证据等级的判断</strong>。</p>\n<h2 id=\"本-hub-vs-兄弟-hub-的分工\">本 hub vs 兄弟 hub 的分工</h2><table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>Hub</th>\n<th>回答的问题</th>\n<th>与本 hub 的边界</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td><a href=\"../life-and-times/\">生平与时代</a></td>\n<td>他<strong>经历了</strong>什么</td>\n<td>本 hub 引用其生涯节点但不复述</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td><a href=\"../core-contributions/\">核心贡献</a></td>\n<td>他<strong>做出了</strong>什么</td>\n<td>本 hub 追问这些贡献的缺憾与争议</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td><a href=\"../ideas-and-methods/\">思想与方法</a></td>\n<td>他<strong>怎么思考</strong></td>\n<td>本 hub 借其「求真」理念评价真伪问题</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td><a href=\"../major-works/\">代表成就</a></td>\n<td>单件作品<strong>本体</strong></td>\n<td>本 hub 讲作品的未竟、真伪与神话</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td><a href=\"../influence-and-legacy/\">影响与遗产</a></td>\n<td>他<strong>留下了</strong>什么、被怎样记住</td>\n<td>本 hub 拆解「记住」背后的建构与争议</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td><strong>争议与评价（本 hub）</strong></td>\n<td>他<strong>有何缺陷、谜团</strong>，地位如何成立</td>\n<td>聚焦缺憾·真伪·神话祛魅·总评</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<p>与 <a href=\"../influence-and-legacy/\">影响与遗产</a> 的分工最需澄清：那个 hub 讲「身后影响如何发生」（正面的遗产机制），本 hub 讲「这些影响与声望中哪些是建构、哪些经得起证据检验」（批判的祛魅视角）。两者互补，常交叉引用。</p>\n<h2 id=\"章节与推荐学习路径\">章节与推荐学习路径</h2><pre class=\"mermaid\" data-diagram-type=\"flowchart\" data-source=\"flowchart LR&#10;    A[1 未竟之作&lt;br/&gt;可清点的缺憾] --&gt; B[2 谜团与真伪&lt;br/&gt;神话如何被制造]&#10;    B --&gt; C[3 多元评价&lt;br/&gt;祛魅与总评]\">flowchart LR\n    A[1 未竟之作&lt;br/&gt;可清点的缺憾] --&gt; B[2 谜团与真伪&lt;br/&gt;神话如何被制造]\n    B --&gt; C[3 多元评价&lt;br/&gt;祛魅与总评]</pre><ol>\n<li><strong><a href=\"unfinished/\">未竟之作</a></strong> — <a href=\"unfinished/the-unfinished-works\">未竟的作品</a>（不足 20 件存世、约 1/3 未完成；三类未竟机制）、<a href=\"unfinished/procrastination-and-perfectionism\">拖延与完美主义</a>（拆开两种相反的心理机制，含瓦萨里记载的委托纠纷）。</li>\n<li><strong><a href=\"mysteries/\">谜团与真伪</a></strong> — <a href=\"mysteries/myths-and-legends\">神话与传说</a>（从瓦萨里 1550 到《达·芬奇密码》的造神链）、<a href=\"mysteries/the-question-of-attribution\">真伪的争议</a>（《救世主》4.5 亿美元归属案与普拉多降级）。</li>\n<li><strong><a href=\"diverse-appraisals/\">多元评价</a></strong> — <a href=\"diverse-appraisals/genius-reconsidered\">重新审视天才</a>（三波修正主义，区分有效纠偏与过度解构）、<a href=\"diverse-appraisals/historical-assessment\">历史地位的评判</a>（声望曲线与「改变历史 vs 预见历史」的双层总评）。</li>\n</ol>\n<p><strong>前置</strong>：建议先读 <a href=\"../core-contributions/\">核心贡献</a> 与 <a href=\"../major-works/\">代表成就</a>，了解「他做了什么」之后，本 hub 对这些成就的缺憾与争议的追问才有依托；本 hub 多次引用 <a href=\"../ideas-and-methods/observation/\">思想与方法·观察</a> 的「经验至上」理念作为评价真伪的标尺。</p>\n<p><strong>读者</strong>：对达·芬奇成就已有基本了解、想超越颂歌、用证据等级的方式批判性地评价这位天才的读者。</p>\n","chapters":[{"seq":1,"slug":"unfinished","title":"未竟与拖延","docCount":2,"url":"/l-doc-books/c/people/leonardo-da-vinci/controversies-and-appraisal/unfinished","docs":[{"seq":1,"slug":"the-unfinished-works","title":"未竟的作品","url":"/l-doc-books/c/people/leonardo-da-vinci/controversies-and-appraisal/unfinished/the-unfinished-works"},{"seq":2,"slug":"procrastination-and-perfectionism","title":"拖延与完美主义","url":"/l-doc-books/c/people/leonardo-da-vinci/controversies-and-appraisal/unfinished/procrastination-and-perfectionism"}]},{"seq":2,"slug":"mysteries","title":"谜团与传说","docCount":2,"url":"/l-doc-books/c/people/leonardo-da-vinci/controversies-and-appraisal/mysteries","docs":[{"seq":1,"slug":"myths-and-legends","title":"神话与传说","url":"/l-doc-books/c/people/leonardo-da-vinci/controversies-and-appraisal/mysteries/myths-and-legends"},{"seq":2,"slug":"the-question-of-attribution","title":"真伪的争议","url":"/l-doc-books/c/people/leonardo-da-vinci/controversies-and-appraisal/mysteries/the-question-of-attribution"}]},{"seq":3,"slug":"diverse-appraisals","title":"多元评价","docCount":2,"url":"/l-doc-books/c/people/leonardo-da-vinci/controversies-and-appraisal/diverse-appraisals","docs":[{"seq":1,"slug":"genius-reconsidered","title":"重新审视天才","url":"/l-doc-books/c/people/leonardo-da-vinci/controversies-and-appraisal/diverse-appraisals/genius-reconsidered"},{"seq":2,"slug":"historical-assessment","title":"历史地位的评判","url":"/l-doc-books/c/people/leonardo-da-vinci/controversies-and-appraisal/diverse-appraisals/historical-assessment"}]}]}